@startuml
title VPC-D06 Vendor Payment Acknowledgment Flow
skinparam shadowing false

participant "Central PMS\npayment finality authority" as Central
participant "Resolved Site POS Server\nfiscal authority" as POS
participant "Vendor PMS connector" as Connector
participant "Vendor PMS / HCP" as Vendor
participant "Reconciliation" as Recon
participant "Audit / Event" as Audit

Central -> Central : record platform payment finality
Central -> POS : request Sales Invoice issuance
POS --> Central : fiscal document identity/status
Central -> Central : record fiscal reference
Central -> Connector : request vendor acknowledgment if policy allows
Connector -> Vendor : notify vendor payment outcome
alt acknowledged
  Vendor --> Connector : accepted / already paid
  Connector --> Central : normalized acknowledgment result
else failed / timeout / unavailable / unknown
  Vendor --> Connector : failure or no safe result
  Connector --> Central : normalized failure context
  Central -> Recon : queue / escalate per later policy
end
Connector -> Audit : record acknowledgment context

note bottom
Acknowledgment is downstream of Central PMS finality and fiscal handling.
Retry and exit-block policy remain open.
end note
@enduml
